# Development JWT signing keys, generated on first run by `LocalFileKeyProvider`.
#
# `deploy/README.md` and `deploy/config/enclave.example.yaml` have both said this directory was
# git-ignored since M0, and it was not: the provider writes `<kid>.pkcs8.der` and `index.json`, and
# the rules above match `*.pem` and `*.key`. Found wiring the key provider into the binary
# (`ENC-687`), where the directory first acquired a caller.
/deploy/config/dev-keys/
